{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56819","headline":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序） 一 · 项宗","name":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驾歘控清虚，徘徊西华馆。\n琼林既神杪，虎旗逐烟散，慧风振丹旍，明烛朗八焕。\n解襟庸房里，神铃鸣蒨粲。\n栖景若林柯，九弦玄中弹。\n遗我积世忧，释此千年叹。\n怡盼无极已，终夜复待旦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}